CREDITS — Một vòng lộn, mười bốn năm (a 10-minute film about Journey to the West)

Text and film
  The essay, the narration and every Vietnamese rendering in this film are original to it.
  The 1592 novel 西遊記 (世德堂本, attributed to 吳承恩 / Ngô Thừa Ân) is public domain.
  No existing translation is quoted; the Vietnamese wording is the film's own.
  The paper figures are generic cut-outs drawn from the text's descriptions only — no adaptation's
  characters, costumes, sets, logos or music are used or referenced on screen.
  Chapter citations for every claim on screen: research/FACTS.md.

Voice
  Vietnamese narration: Microsoft Edge neural voice "vi-VN-HoaiMyNeural" via edge-tts
  (rany2/edge-tts, LGPL-3.0). https://github.com/rany2/edge-tts
  Synthetic speech. No real person's voice was cloned or used.

Speech-to-text check (build-time only, no audio in the film)
  faster-whisper "small" and "medium" (Systran, MIT) — https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper
  Used to verify every narration line; the accepted transcripts are in voice/lines.json.

