Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  Be Vietnam Pro — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Be+Vietnam+Pro
  Fredoka         — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Fredoka
  Lilita One      — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Lilita+One
  Subset locally into fonts/ by fetch_fonts.mjs, so the film renders offline and offline-free of
  any font-tracking request.

Music and sound
  The score is synthesised from scratch in mix.py (music box, pizzicato, clarinet, glockenspiel,
  toy piano, low piano, brushed kit, drone, gong) and the foley is synthesised in the same file
  (paper, creak, stamp, splash, tear, water). No sample library, no recorded music, no stock sound.

Software
  three.js r170 — MIT — https://threejs.org
  Node.js and ffmpeg for the render and the master.

